                <details>
                    <summary>Do you service all of Utah County?</summary>
                    <div class="faq-content">
                        <p>Yes, we serve all areas throughout Utah County, including Provo, Orem, American Fork, Lehi, Spanish Fork, Springville, Payson, and all surrounding communities.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item fade-in">
                <details>
                    <summary>What makes you different from other pest control companies?</summary>
                    <div class="faq-content">
                        <p>Most of the pest industry runs on a million-dollar door-knocking mentality, with not enough regulation or inspectors enforcing education and compliance. We're the opposite: 25+ years of specialized experience, 35+ TV news appearances, humane methods, and third-party quality assurance on every job. No rookies. No high-pressure sales pitches. Just real expertise applied to your home.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item fade-in">
                <details>
                    <summary>Are you the people who knock on my door in the summer?</summary>
                    <div class="faq-content">
                        <p>No. We don't do door-to-door sales, and we don't hire summer reps with two weeks of training. Every Arrow of Light job is performed by Trent or Wes — licensed professionals with decades of field experience. If you want us, you call us — and the inspection is free.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item fade-in">
                <details>
                    <summary>Do you offer recurring pest control programs?</summary>
                    <div class="faq-content">
